{"unit_id":"JeremyWangCY__win-pilot#feature-desktop","repo":"JeremyWangCY/win-pilot","commit":"e2d1201932afbeb23199efa4b2be5b861cec57c1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Win-Pilot 的功能「Windows 桌面操作」：通过 computer 工具发现应用和窗口，并执行点击、拖动、滚动、键盘输入等桌面动作。使用动作名称及目标窗口作为输入，返回操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1449","lib/computer-action.js:122"]}
